* Version 3.0.0-beta.1 - 2026 modernization preview
---------------------------------
- Require CPython 3.14 and use pyproject-based packaging
- Replace WSGI with FastAPI, ASGI, and Uvicorn
- Implement Mail Autoconfig 1.2, corrected Autodiscover XML, experimental
  Autodiscover v2, PACC-03, OAuth public-client metadata, and password-free
  Mobileconfig
- Add deterministic OpenAPI, a modular operator CLI, DNS record generation and
  read-only multi-domain publication checks,
  Docker E2E, SPDX/CycloneDX SBOMs, and security scan gates
- Omit invalid self-referential CNAMEs from generated DNS plans and add a
  digest-pinned, hardened, synthetic production deployment example
- Document OAuth discovery and future DCR publication without inventing a
  registration endpoint
- Let protocol probes validate the Microsoft 602 contract when MobileSync is
  intentionally not configured
- Restore the browser-based Apple profile workflow with a password-free,
  multilingual Mobileconfig form, persistent auto/light/dark themes, and
  same-origin assets aligned with the RNS Crypto design system
- Cover negative MobileSync probe errors and document canonical DNS CNAME
  suppression
- Replace the historical automx-test shell client with automx probe commands
- Add credential-free local rendering of exact Autoconfig, both Autodiscover
  schemas, Mobileconfig, and PACC bytes through the shared ASGI document service
- Restore optional Mobileconfig signing with bounded in-process RSA/SHA-256 CMS,
  fail-closed key validation, signature inspection, and signed probe support

